Desktop Companion

Features

* Wake word
* Continuous listening
* Notifications

---

## Phase 3

ESP32 Device

Features

* Speaker
* Microphone
* Cloud communication

---

## Phase 4

Commercial Product

* Mobile App
* OTA Updates
* User Accounts
* Subscription

